### Create payment
POST http://localhost:8080/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idempotencyKey": "PAY-LOCAL-001",
  "sourceAccount": "ACC-001",
  "destinationAccount": "ACC-002",
  "amount": 120.50,
  "currency": "GBP",
  "reference": "Local API test"
}

### Get all payments
GET http://localhost:8080/api/payments

### Get payments by status
GET http://localhost:8080/api/payments?status=CREATED

### Get payment details
GET http://localhost:8080/api/payments/1/details

### Validate payment
POST http://localhost:8080/api/payments/1/validate

### Send payment
POST http://localhost:8080/api/payments/2/send

### Complete payment
POST http://localhost:8080/api/payments/3/complete

### Fail payment
POST http://localhost:8080/api/payments/2/fail
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "errorCode": "NETWORK_ERROR",
  "errorMessage": "Simulated network error"
}
